    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="21547541-5080-5eb8-91fe-0aec1b82308b" activityNameId="23a92ba2-4ea5-5638-a831-9e748c6a5230" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity imports</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity imports
Electricity imports in this dataset are representing physical electricity imports as far as such data is available from statistical data sources, in case of data gaps supplemented by trade flow information that also includes physical amounts. Unrealistic values were removed where present. The imported electricity is assumed to reflect the corresponding foreign consumption mix. UUID: 76c6b18f-67d1-3fe8-a88b-f6cf59b93b3b
Included are the shares of corresponding electricity production by technology and country at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to utilities and auto-producers.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76c6b18f-67d1-3fe8-a88b-f6cf59b93b3b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="ad936252-e7cd-5398-add6-c69bd0f01e6c" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
